# Architecture

Educational **account-model PoW blockchain simulator** with HTTP sync — not production cryptocurrency.

## Layout
```
backend/
  api.py, models.py, config.py, settings.py
  services/     # BlockchainService, WalletService, etc.
  network/      # HTTP peer sync
  persistence/  # chain.json, wallets.enc
frontend/
  index.html, style.css
  js/           # api, ui, events, app, + feature modules
  css/          # feature stylesheets
data/           # gitignored runtime state
scripts/dev.sh
```

## Boundaries
- Single balance source: Blockchain.get_balance()
- Validation in blockchain.py + validation.py — keep consistent
- Frontend never implements consensus; displays API state

## Simplifications (intentional)
- Float amounts, server-side signing, HTTP not P2P, no Merkle in headers

## Evolution principle
Extend existing abstractions. See IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md and backend/ARCHITECTURE.md.
